# Build context optimization — 避免把大文件/本地数据打进镜像构建上下文
agent/.venv
agent/__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
agent/agent.db
agent/chroma_db
backend/data.db
backend/uploads
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/src-tauri
deploy/dist
# 服务密钥由运行环境注入，避免 COPY agent/ 将本机配置写入镜像。
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
.git
.github
